<name>Engine</name>
<section id="10024_S000T" variety="S000T">
<name>Starting</name>
<ttl id="10024_S000T_744HN_T007Z" variety="T007Z">
<name>Smart Entry &amp; Start System (Start System)</name>
<para id="X394000014D00RC" category="C" type-id="30530" name-id="161XI-00" from="200612">
<dtccode>B2288</dtccode>
<dtcname>Steering Lock/Unlock Malfunction</dtcname>
<subpara id="X394000014D00RC_10" type-id="31" category="03" proc-id="RM0550J___00004B000000">
<name>Circuit Description</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<list1 type="nonmark">
<item>
<ptxt>This DTC is output when the instrument panel J/B assembly (main body ECU) cannot determine steering lock unlock within the specified time.</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
<atten3>
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>When using the TaSCAN with the IG OFF, repeatedly turn any door courtesy light switch ON and OFF (at intervals of 1.5 seconds or less) until communication between the TaSCAN and the vehicle starts.</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>The Smart Entry &amp; Start System (start system) has functions that use multiplex communication. First, follow "How to Proceed with Troubleshooting" and confirm that there is no malfunction in the communication system before proceeding with troubleshooting.</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</atten3>
<atten4>
<ptxt>When the instrument panel J/B assembly (main body ECU) is replaced with a new ECU and the battery negative terminal is connected, it enters the IG ON state. Also, when the battery is removed and reinstalled, the power source returns to the state it was in when the battery was removed.</ptxt>
</atten4>
<table frame="all" colsep="1" rowsep="1" pgwide="1">
<tgroup cols="3" colsep="1" rowsep="1">
<colspec colnum="01" colname="C01" colwidth="1.01in"/>
<colspec colnum="02" colname="C02" colwidth="2.20in"/>
<colspec colnum="03" colname="C03" colwidth="3.88in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry colname="C01" valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>DTC No.</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname="C02" valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>DTC Detection Condition</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname="C03" valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Inspection Area</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry colname="C01" valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>B2288</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname="C02" valign="middle" align="left">
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>Instrument panel J/B assembly (main body ECU) cannot determine steering lock unlock within the specified time</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
<entry colname="C03" valign="middle" align="left">
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>Instrument Panel J/B Assembly (Main Body ECU)</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Steering Lock Actuator (Steering Lock ECU)</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Steering Lock System</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Wire Harness or Connector</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</content5>
</subpara>
<subpara id="X394000014D00RC_14" type-id="32" category="03" proc-id="RM0550J___00004B400000">
<name>Wiring Diagram</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="A161587J08" width="7.106578999in" height="2.775699831in"/>
</figure>
</content5>
</subpara>
<subpara id="X394000014D00RC_11" type-id="51" category="05">
<name>Inspection Procedure</name>
</subpara>
<subpara id="X394000014D00RC_13" type-id="01" category="01">
<name>Procedure</name>
<testgrp id="X394000014D00RC_13_0001" proc-id="RM0550J___00004B100000">
<testtitle>Check DTC</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09991-70200</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>Clear the DTCs.</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Check the DTCs again 18 to 22 seconds after turning the IG ON, and check that no DTC is output.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Result</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="2">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="3.08in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.05in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Result</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Proceed to</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>DTC is output again</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>A</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>No DTC is output</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>B</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="X394000014D00RC_13_0004" fin="false">A</down>
<right ref="X394000014D00RC_13_0009" fin="true">B</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="X394000014D00RC_13_0004" proc-id="RM0550J___00004B200000">
<testtitle>Inspect Wire Harness (Instrument Panel J/B Assembly (Main Body ECU) - Steering Lock Actuator (Steering Lock ECU))</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09082-00030</s-number>
</sstitem>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09083-00170</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>Resistance Inspection </ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="A161600J02" width="7.106578999in" height="2.775699831in"/>
</figure>
<test2>
<ptxt>Disconnect instrument panel J/B assembly (main body ECU) connector V and the steering lock actuator (steering lock ECU) connector.</ptxt>
</test2>
<test2>
<ptxt>Using SST (Toyota electrical tester), inspect the resistance between the terminals of the vehicle side wire harness connector.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Resistance</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="3">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="2.63in"/>
<colspec colname="COLSPEC0" colwidth="0.70in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="0.80in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Tester Connection</ptxt>
<ptxt>(Main Body ECU - Steering Lock ECU)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Condition</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Standard</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>V18(SLP) - 4(SLP1)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Always</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Below 1 Ω</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
</test2>
<test2>
<ptxt>Using SST (Toyota electrical tester), inspect the resistance between each terminal of the vehicle side wire harness connector and body ground.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Resistance</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="3">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="2.63in"/>
<colspec colname="COLSPEC1" colwidth="0.68in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="0.82in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Tester Connection</ptxt>
<ptxt>(Main Body ECU or Steering Lock ECU - Body Ground)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Condition</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Standard</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>V18 (SLP) or 4 (SLP1) - Body ground</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Always</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>10k Ω or higher</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
</test2>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="X394000014D00RC_13_0005" fin="false">OK</down>
<right ref="X394000014D00RC_13_0007" fin="true">NG</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="X394000014D00RC_13_0005" proc-id="RM0550J___00004B300000">
<testtitle>Replace with Known Good Instrument Panel J/B Assembly (Main Body ECU)</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<test1>
<ptxt>Replace the instrument panel J/B assembly (main body ECU) with a new or known good one and perform the inspection in step 1 again.</ptxt>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="X394000014D00RC_13_0003" fin="true">OK</down>
<right ref="X394000014D00RC_13_0006" fin="true">NG</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="X394000014D00RC_13_0006">
<testtitle>Go to Steering Lock System (Steering Lock Is Not Released)<xref label="Seep01" href="RM0000005JE00WX_01"/>
</testtitle>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="X394000014D00RC_13_0009">
<testtitle>Perform Simulation Method<xref label="Seep01" href="RM0000005D701ZX"/>
</testtitle>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="X394000014D00RC_13_0007">
<testtitle>Repair or Replace Wire Harness or Connector</testtitle>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="X394000014D00RC_13_0003">
<testtitle>OK (instrument panel J/B assembly malfunction)</testtitle>
</testgrp>
</subpara>
</para>
</ttl>
</section>
</servcat>
</pub>
